      "content": "\"stop the effort entirely\"... i don't know if i mean just quitting my job or something more permanent. it just feels like there's no way out that doesn't involve more struggle. like, how is anyone supposed to actually find peace when the world just keeps demanding more and more from you? it feels like a trap.",
